  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">HUDF/MDP Vilnius gaml st</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">HUDF/MDP Vilnius old town</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Vilnius City aims at promoting sust. development in Uzupis and Paupys neighbourhoods in Vilnius Old Town by providing co-ordinated development opportunities in the area. The goal of the pre-feasibility study is i.a. to identify needs and costing of engineering infrastructure and utility services in area.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Vilnius stad arbetar f&#xf6;r en uth&#xe5;llig utveckling i Uzupis och Paupys omr&#xe5;den i Old Town, genom att tillhandah&#xe5;lla koordinerade utv.m&#xf6;jligh i omr&#xe5;det. Syftet med insatsen &#xe4;r bl a att identifiera behov av och kostnader f&#xf6;r infrastrukturinvesteringar och f&#xf6;rb&#xe4;ttring av kommunala tj&#xe4;nster i omr&#xe5;det.</narrative>
  </description>
